---
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About — Vedant Neve"
	description="About Vedant Neve (0bVdnt) — LLVM contributor, compiler engineer, systems programmer, and CS undergrad building things from first principles."
>
	<div class="about-hero">
		<div class="about-terminal">
			<div class="about-terminal-bar">
				<span class="dot red"></span>
				<span class="dot yellow"></span>
				<span class="dot green"></span>
				<span class="about-terminal-title">~/blogs/about</span>
			</div>
			<div class="about-terminal-body">
				<div class="about-prompt"><span class="prompt-symbol">$</span> cat /etc/vedant.conf</div>
				<div class="about-output">
					<div class="about-field"><span class="field-key">name</span> <span class="field-eq">=</span> <span class="field-val">"Vedant Neve"</span></div>
					<div class="about-field"><span class="field-key">handle</span> <span class="field-eq">=</span> <span class="field-val">"0bVdnt"</span></div>
					<div class="about-field"><span class="field-key">location</span> <span class="field-eq">=</span> <span class="field-val">"Pune, India"</span></div>
					<div class="about-field"><span class="field-key">affiliation</span> <span class="field-eq">=</span> <span class="field-val">"CS Undergrad @ SPPU (CGPA: 9.6/10)"</span></div>
					<div class="about-field"><span class="field-key">domains</span> <span class="field-eq">=</span> <span class="field-val">["Compilers", "Systems", "GPU Compute", "AI/ML", "Mathematics"]</span></div>
					<div class="about-field"><span class="field-key">leetcode</span> <span class="field-eq">=</span> <span class="field-val">"Knight"</span></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<section class="about-section">
		<h2 class="section-title"><span class="section-icon">👋</span> Who am I?</h2>
		<p>
			I'm <strong>Vedant</strong> — I want to learn everything about everything.
			I build things that make me go <em>"Huh, that's interesting!"</em> and <em>"Wow, I didn't know that was possible!"</em>,
			and then I write about them here.
			I have a soft spot for compilers, low-level programming, GPU graphics, and performance optimization —
			and I'm always up for exploring new domains and technologies.
		</p>
		<p>
			My primary focus is on compiler engineering — I'm an active
			<a href="https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LLVM</a> contributor,
			working on things like GVN optimizations, SelectionDAG pattern matchers for funnel shifts,
			and libc refactors. My research interests revolve around compiler optimizations, program transformations,
			static analysis, LLVM pass infrastructure, parallelizing compilers, and IR-level code generation.
			I'm currently exploring source-level CUDA↔ROCm transpilation for portable GPU compute.
		</p>
		<p>
			On the projects side, I've built
			<a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/chakravyuha" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chakravyuha</a> — an LLVM-based code obfuscation framework with control flow flattening, polymorphic string encryption, and dead code injection;
			<a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/obvcc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">obvcc</a> — a multi-language C compiler (Rust lexer + OCaml parser → x86-64 assembly);
			<a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/raylib_cuda" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Raylib-CUDA</a> — a zero-copy GPU compute interop library using OpenGL DMA;
			and <a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/obv-os" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">obv-OS</a> — an operating system from scratch. I also dabble in
			<a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/http-c" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HTTP servers in pure C</a>,
			<a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/pixlgo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">terminal media players in Go</a>,
			and <a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt/game-of-life-webassembly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WebAssembly experiments</a>.
		</p>
		<p>
			I lead the Competitive Coding Club at my college and co-lead the DSA & CP track for
			Google Developers Group on campus — organizing ICPC-style contests and leading technical sessions
			on algorithms and data structures.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="about-section">
		<h2 class="section-title"><span class="section-icon">⚡</span> Tech Stack</h2>
		<div class="tech-grid">
			<div class="tech-category">
				<h4>Languages</h4>
				<div class="tech-pills">
					<span class="tech-pill">C++</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">C</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Rust</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Go</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Python</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">OCaml</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">TypeScript</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Bash</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">SQL</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="tech-category">
				<h4>Compilers & Systems</h4>
				<div class="tech-pills">
					<span class="tech-pill">LLVM/Clang</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">GCC</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">CUDA</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">POSIX</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">OpenGL</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">WebAssembly</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="tech-category">
				<h4>Build & Debug</h4>
				<div class="tech-pills">
					<span class="tech-pill">CMake</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Bazel</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Cargo</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">GDB</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Valgrind</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">QEMU</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Docker</span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="tech-category">
				<h4>AI / ML</h4>
				<div class="tech-pills">
					<span class="tech-pill">PyTorch</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">TensorFlow</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Keras</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">NumPy</span>
					<span class="tech-pill">Pandas</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="about-section philosophy">
		<blockquote>
			"To truly understand something, you must build it from the first principles up, and then break it down to its core components, and then put it back together again in a way that is uniquely your own."
		</blockquote>
	</section>

	<section class="about-section connect-section">
		<h2 class="section-title"><span class="section-icon">🔗</span> Connect</h2>
		<div class="connect-links">
			<a href="https://github.com/0bVdnt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="connect-link">
				<svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="20" height="20"><path fill="currentColor" d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.012 8.012 0 0 0 16 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z"/></svg>
				GitHub
			</a>
			<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/vedantneve" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="connect-link">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 01-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 112.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
				LinkedIn
			</a>
			<a href="mailto:vedantneve13@gmail.com" class="connect-link">
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/></svg>
				Email
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	/* ===== About Hero Terminal ===== */
	.about-hero {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.about-terminal {
		border-radius: 12px;
		border: 1px solid var(--surface2);
		background: var(--crust);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
		overflow: hidden;
		animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease forwards;
	}

	.about-terminal-bar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 12px 16px;
		background: var(--mantle);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--surface1);
	}

	.dot {
		width: 12px;
		height: 12px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
	}

	.dot.red { background: var(--red); }
	.dot.yellow { background: var(--yellow); }
	.dot.green { background: var(--green); }

	.about-terminal-title {
		flex: 1;
		text-align: center;
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.75em;
		color: var(--overlay1);
		margin-right: 56px;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.about-terminal-body {
		padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
	}

	.about-prompt {
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.9em;
		color: var(--subtext0);
		margin-bottom: 1em;
	}

	.prompt-symbol {
		color: var(--green);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.about-output {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.4em;
	}

	.about-field {
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.85em;
	}

	.field-key { color: var(--blue); }
	.field-eq { color: var(--overlay1); }
	.field-val { color: var(--green); }

	/* ===== Sections ===== */
	.about-section {
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 1.4em;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text);
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5em;
	}

	.section-icon {
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}

	.about-section p {
		color: var(--subtext0);
		line-height: 1.8;
		font-size: 1.02em;
	}

	.about-section p strong {
		color: var(--text);
		-webkit-text-fill-color: var(--text);
	}

	.about-section p em {
		color: var(--mauve);
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.about-section p a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--accent);
		transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.about-section p a:hover {
		border-bottom-style: solid;
	}

	/* ===== Tech Stack ===== */
	.tech-grid {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1.25rem;
	}

	.tech-category h4 {
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.85em;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--overlay1);
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.tech-pills {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.4rem;
	}

	.tech-pill {
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.75em;
		padding: 0.3em 0.7em;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: var(--surface0);
		color: var(--subtext1);
		border: 1px solid var(--surface1);
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.tech-pill:hover {
		background: var(--surface1);
		color: var(--text);
		border-color: var(--surface2);
	}

	/* ===== Philosophy ===== */
	.philosophy blockquote {
		font-size: 1.05em;
		line-height: 1.7;
		font-style: italic;
		color: var(--subtext1);
		border-left: 4px solid var(--mauve);
		padding: 1.25em 1.5em;
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* ===== Connect ===== */
	.connect-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.connect-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5em;
		font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
		font-size: 0.88em;
		padding: 0.6em 1.2em;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: var(--card-bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
		color: var(--subtext1) !important;
		text-decoration: none !important;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.connect-link:hover {
		border-color: var(--accent);
		color: var(--accent) !important;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
	}

	/* ===== Responsive ===== */
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.about-terminal-body {
			padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		}

		.connect-links {
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.connect-link {
			justify-content: center;
		}
	}

	/* ===== Reduced Motion ===== */
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.about-terminal {
			animation: none;
		}

		.tech-pill,
		.connect-link {
			transition: none !important;
		}

		.connect-link:hover {
			transform: none !important;
		}
	}
</style>